OL,3,ASarah Ferguson expected back in the UK
OL,4,A'shortly', source says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Duchess of York is expected
OL,7,F"back in the UK shortly", a source
OL,8,Fclose to her has told the BBC.
OL,10,FSarah Ferguson was thought to be living
OL,11,Fabroad after she was forced to move out
OL,12,Fof Royal Lodge in Windsor, which she
OL,13,Fshared with her ex-husband Andrew
OL,14,FMountbatten-Windsor, in October.
OL,16,FFerguson had last seen in public at the
OL,17,FDuchess of Kent's funeral the previous
OL,18,Fmonth.
OL,20,FShe is reportedly renting out a gated
OL,21,Fproperty in the Home Counties,
OL,22,Faccording to the Sun newspaper.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
