OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-seven people have been killed
OL,7,Fand almost 400 evacuated after a
OL,8,FRussian strike hit a warehouse near
OL,9,FKyiv, triggering a fire and a series of
OL,10,Fexplosions.
OL,12,FRegional governor Tymur Tkachenko said
OL,13,Fa further 42 people, including four
OL,14,Fchildren, were injured after the
OL,15,FRussian drone strike in the Bucha
OL,16,Fdistrict.
OL,18,FAn investigation has been launched into
OL,19,Fwhether ammunition was being stored at
OL,20,Fthe site, where search and rescue
OL,21,Foperations were ongoing early on
OL,22,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
